        ("What is the purpose of the HTML5 History API?", "The History API (pushState, replaceState, popstate) enables Single Page Applications to change the URL without full browser page reloads.", "Intermediate", "Concept", "history.pushState({ page: 2 }, '', '/page-2');", "What event fires when the back button is clicked?"),
