        ("What is the difference between the 'id' and 'class' attributes?", "'id' must be unique per document and identifies a single element. 'class' is non-unique and groups multiple elements for shared styling.", "Easy", "Comparison", "<div id=\"header\" class=\"container dark\"></div>", "Which has higher CSS specificity: id or class?"),
